# Job 5: K2, one port message per small PHP response.
# 597 wave 4. Set REV_B to the K2 branch (pr/NNN) before running.
# Measured on master 2026-10-07: asys_sendmsg 3.64 to 3.70 per request at hello.php c=6.
JOB=05-k2-one-message
ISSUE=https://github.com/freeunitorg/freeunit/issues/597
REV_A=origin/master
REV_B=pr/NNN
WORKLOAD=hello
CONNS=6 32
WARM=2
DUR=8
REPS=2
PERF=1
STRACE=1
PRIMARY=s_cycles
EXPECT=asys_sendmsg down by 1 or more per request, rsys_recvmsg down, s_cycles at least 5 percent lower (597 estimates 8 to 15 us)
FALSIFY=asys_sendmsg unchanged, or s_cycles NO CLAIM in both cells
